+# Work Item — EPMCDME-13611
+
+**External Ticket**: https://jiraeu.epam.com/browse/EPMCDME-13611
+**Type**: Bug
+**Priority**: Major
+**Status**: Ready for dev
+
+## Title
+
+Copy table button remains visible after copying and moving the mouse away
+
+## Acceptance Criteria
+
+- Copy button appears when user hovers over a Markdown table in assistant output.
+- After click, table content is copied as expected.
+- Copy button is hidden when pointer leaves the table/button hover area.
+- Copy button does not remain visible until an additional click.
+- Existing message/table copy functionality is not broken.
+- Behavior verified with a generated Markdown table in AI Assistant output.
